@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = your_jwt_token_here
@quoteId = insert_quote_id_here

### List quotes (first page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List quotes (next page using cursor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes?limit=10&cursor={{quoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
